  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "style": "GalleryLabel",
      "text": "FICTIONAL EXHIBITION / VISITOR GUIDE"
    },
    {
      "style": "Title",
      "text": "Objects and Light"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Three forms. Three ways to look."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Follow a curve, look through a gap and trace an unfinished line. This fictional exhibition brings three…"
    },
    {
      "style": "GalleryNote",
      "text": "Left to right: 01 Crescent Vessel; 02 Slotted Panel; 03 Open Loop. Original AI-generated concept…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Choose a detail before you choose an explanation. Each stop offers a short interpretation and a…"
    },
    {
      "style": "GalleryNote",
      "text": "A sample visitor guide for reading on paper or screen. No real venue, artist, collection record or…"
    },
    {
      "style": "GalleryRoute",
      "text": "Start with the route key → page 2"
    },
    {
      "style": "GalleryLabel",
      "text": "FICTIONAL EXHIBITION / VISITOR GUIDE"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Choose your sequence"
    },
    {
      "style": "GalleryLead",
      "text": "Begin with one visible detail"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "The numbers mark a suggested reading and looking sequence. They are not room numbers, a floor plan or a…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "The full sequence"
    },
    {
      "style": "GalleryRoute",
      "text": "01 Crescent Vessel — follow the curved rim → page 3"
    },
    {
      "style": "GalleryRoute",
      "text": "02 Slotted Panel — compare three openings → page 4"
    },
    {
      "style": "GalleryRoute",
      "text": "03 Open Loop — find where the line stops → page 5"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "A shorter pairing"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Try 01, then 03. Compare the vessel’s inward curve with the loop’s open outline. This is a choice of…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Use the guide your way"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Read an entry, look back at the illustration, then return to its question. Start at any stop; each…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Before adapting this for a real venue"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Confirm object permissions, current visitor information and the venue’s actual access arrangements. Ask…"
    },
    {
      "style": "GalleryNote",
      "text": "After your selected stops, turn to page 6 to compare one detail and plan a next look."
    },
    {
      "style": "GalleryLabel",
      "text": "FICTIONAL EXHIBITION / VISITOR GUIDE"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "01 / Crescent Vessel"
    },
    {
      "style": "GalleryLead",
      "text": "An edge that draws the eye inward"
    },
    {
      "style": "GalleryMeta",
      "text": "Imagined material: matte ivory ceramic. Concept illustration; no real maker, date or collection record."
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Look first"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Trace the curved upper edge in the illustration. Notice where the pale outer surface meets the darker…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "One possible reading"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "The broad, open curve can suggest both a container and a shelter. That is a fictional curatorial…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Keep a question open"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Which visible detail makes this shape feel open or enclosed to you? Another viewer may choose a…"
    },
    {
      "style": "GalleryNote",
      "text": "01 / Original concept illustration. Material is imagined; the rendering does not establish fabrication,…"
    },
    {
      "style": "GalleryRoute",
      "text": "Continue to 02 Slotted Panel → page 4"
    },
    {
      "style": "GalleryRoute",
      "text": "Return to the route key → page 2"
    },
    {
      "style": "GalleryLabel",
      "text": "FICTIONAL EXHIBITION / VISITOR GUIDE"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "02 / Slotted Panel"
    },
    {
      "style": "GalleryLead",
      "text": "An opening is part of the form"
    },
    {
      "style": "GalleryMeta",
      "text": "Imagined material: terracotta. Concept illustration; no real maker, date or collection record."
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Look first"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Count the three elongated openings. Compare their rounded tops with the straighter outer sides of the…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "One possible reading"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "The repeated openings turn empty space into a visible pattern. In this invented exhibition, the panel…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Keep a question open"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Does your eye follow the solid surface or the openings first? Point to a feature that supports your…"
    },
    {
      "style": "GalleryNote",
      "text": "02 / Original concept illustration. Material is imagined; the rendering does not establish fabrication,…"
    },
    {
      "style": "GalleryRoute",
      "text": "Continue to 03 Open Loop → page 5"
    },
    {
      "style": "GalleryRoute",
      "text": "Return to the route key → page 2"
    },
    {
      "style": "GalleryLabel",
      "text": "FICTIONAL EXHIBITION / VISITOR GUIDE"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "03 / Open Loop"
    },
    {
      "style": "GalleryLead",
      "text": "A line can leave room to continue"
    },
    {
      "style": "GalleryMeta",
      "text": "Imagined material: brushed silver metal. Concept illustration; no real maker, date or collection record."
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Look first"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Follow the metal strip around the loop. Find the gap at the top and compare the two ends without…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "One possible reading"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "An almost-closed line can invite the eye to complete it. The gap also interrupts that expectation. This…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Keep a question open"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "If the gap disappeared, what would change about the way you look at the shape? Use the illustrated…"
    },
    {
      "style": "GalleryNote",
      "text": "03 / Original concept illustration. Material is imagined; the rendering does not establish fabrication,…"
    },
    {
      "style": "GalleryRoute",
      "text": "Continue to the comparison prompt → page 6"
    },
    {
      "style": "GalleryRoute",
      "text": "Return to the route key → page 2"
    },
    {
      "style": "GalleryLabel",
      "text": "FICTIONAL EXHIBITION / VISITOR GUIDE"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Take one detail with you"
    },
    {
      "style": "GalleryLead",
      "text": "Compare, then choose a next look"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Choose two entries. Name a visible similarity or difference before adding an interpretation. There is…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "My comparison"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "I compared objects ______ and ______. The detail I noticed was…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "My next question"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "What would I look at again, and what might change my reading?"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "For a real visit"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Use the real venue’s current information to confirm location, opening hours, admission and access…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "About this guide"
    },
    {
      "style": "GalleryNote",
      "text": "Original fictional exhibition and AI-generated concept illustrations by Studio Templates. Writing draws…"
    },
    {
      "style": "GalleryNote",
      "text": "NPS Harpers Ferry Center — wayside exhibit writing"
    },
    {
      "style": "GalleryRoute",
      "text": "Return to the route key → page 2"
    }
